% Packed-forest LAZY SEMANTICS + CUBE PRUNING — the D63 packed-forest blueprint
% (docs/notes/d63-packed-forest-parsing-blueprint.md). The 7.6M-lexicon sense-product
% blow-up is a same-category OR-ambiguity: pack by (cat_shape, ENF-prov), materialize
% the differing semantics LAZILY, extract k-best per signature by cube pruning. All
% identifiers verified (ACL Anthology / arXiv / DOI) via deep-research wf_0cabeba8-96c.
